BBUUGGSS
     There is no way to supply alternative values for the SDP record.

     There is no way to set net type or multicast address filters.

     bbttppaanndd does not do any address routing except to directly connected uni‐
     cast addresses.  All other packets are multicast.

     As bbttppaanndd uses the BDADDR of the Bluetooth radio as the physical address
     of the tap, only one instance can be run per radio.

     bbttppaanndd can only provide a single service.

